+Intel XeGTAO, pinned at a5b1686c7ea37788eeb3576b5be47f7c03db532c
+https://github.com/GameTechDev/XeGTAO
+Copyright (C) 2016-2021 Intel Corporation; MIT (LICENSE).
+
+XeGTAO.h is unchanged. types.inl embeds that same header for shader preparation.
+core.inl embeds Source/Rendering/Shaders/XeGTAO.hlsli, with four equivalent FXC
+syntax substitutions: integer swizzles 2.xx/4.xx/8.xx become uint2 constructors,
+and dot(..., 1.xxxx) uses float4(1,1,1,1). Its XeGTAO.h include is supplied by
+ShaderSources instead of a runtime filesystem dependency. Raw-string delimiters
+are the only other wrapping. The algorithm is Intel's medium-quality GTAO with
+built-in depth normals, FP32 math/depth and two spatial denoise passes. No temporal
+jitter/history is used. Game integration, viewport crop and color composite live
+in gpu/gtao.cpp; the latter preserves alpha and applies the full AO visibility.
